.SH NAME
frontend/node_modules/@jridgewell/resolve-uri Directory Reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "@jridgewell/resolve-uri"
.PP
.RS 4
Resolve a URI relative to an optional base URI 
.RE
.PP

.PP
Resolve any combination of absolute URIs, protocol-realtive URIs, absolute paths, or relative paths\&.
.SH "Installation"
.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install @jridgewell/resolve\-uri
.fi
.PP
.SH "Usage"
.PP
.PP
.nf
function resolve(input: string, base?: string): string;
.fi
.PP

.PP
.PP
.nf
import resolve from '@jridgewell/resolve\-uri';

resolve('foo', 'https://example\&.com'); // => 'https://example\&.com/foo'
.fi
.PP

.PP
Input  Base  Resolution  Explanation  \fRhttps://example.com\fP  \fIany\fP  \fRhttps://example.com/\fP  Input is normalized only  \fR//example\&.com\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/\fP  \fRhttps://example.com/\fP  Input inherits the base's protocol  \fR//example\&.com\fP  \fIrest\fP  \fR//example\&.com/\fP  Input is normalized only  \fR/example\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/example\fP  Input inherits the base's origin  \fR/example\fP  \fR//base\&.com/\fP  \fR//base\&.com/example\fP  Input inherits the base's host and remains protocol relative  \fR/example\fP  \fIrest\fP  \fR/example\fP  Input is normalized only  \fRexample\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/dir/\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/dir/example\fP  Input is joined with the base  \fRexample\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/file\fP  \fRhttps://base.com/example\fP  Input is joined with the base without its file  \fRexample\fP  \fR//base\&.com/dir/\fP  \fR//base\&.com/dir/example\fP  Input is joined with the base's last directory  \fRexample\fP  \fR//base\&.com/file\fP  \fR//base\&.com/example\fP  Input is joined with the base without its file  \fRexample\fP  \fR/base/dir/\fP  \fR/base/dir/example\fP  Input is joined with the base's last directory  \fRexample\fP  \fR/base/file\fP  \fR/base/example\fP  Input is joined with the base without its file  \fRexample\fP  \fRbase/dir/\fP  \fRbase/dir/example\fP  Input is joined with the base's last directory  \fRexample\fP  \fRbase/file\fP  \fRbase/example\fP  Input is joined with the base without its file  
